	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Vix mihi datur propter affines meos hospites, ut <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pauca ad tuas respondeam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Principio, quod <placeName>Sanenses</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l49">Bielenses</placeName> et bellicum apud nos apparatum attinet, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>pauca ad fratrem scripsi, qui ea tibi communicabit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>studiosos nostros attinet, dabo operam, quantum possum, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut brevi revocentur; velim tamen de illis ut scribe<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>res aliquando ad d. <persName ref="p8012">Hallerum</persName> quaestorem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nescio enim, quam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>multis suspecta sint omnia, quae a me proficiscuntur; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ut enim varia sunt hominum ingenia, sic varie interpretantur <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>multa, prout quisque affectibus praeditus est.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Velim illos <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>alio mitti, cum videam non concordię, sed dissensionis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>materiam praeter spem meam praebere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De <persName>Hoflio</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName>Joh. Hoflius (Höfflin</persName>, s. Lohner), s. auch Bern Burgerbibliothek, cod. 653 (Theologica, von Hoflius geschrieben, z.T. 1551, z.T. März 1555 im Haus von Guldibeck).</note> semper <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>speravi bene; sed prorsus is me fallit; sic alter quoque Herlinus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>De <persName>Ragoio</persName> adhuc bene spero; de <persName ref="p6367">Sapido</persName> minus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>A <persName>Hoflio</persName> vero nihil hic de te sparsum audio; facile e<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>rgo illum excusatum habebis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Utinam non Medicus exau<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ctoratus ad tegendam turpitudinem suam comminisceretur <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>multa; sed prudentes facile intelligunt, quod res est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Quid cum <persName>Zebedaeo</persName> et <persName>Angelo</persName> actum, scripsi proxime.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Interea <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>revocatus Medicus et iterum nobis insciis restitutus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Miserunt et <placeName ref="l167">Genevenses</placeName> ministri iterum unum ex eorum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>numero praeterita septimana huc, qui senatui instaret <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>et peteret, ut vel ipsis coram <persName>Zebedaeo</persName> e<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>t <persName>Angelo</persName> defendere se et causam suam dicere concederetur <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>vel synodus conscriberetur ecclesiarum, in qua <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>doctrinae ratio et tota haec causa discuteretur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed neutrum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>senatui placuit certis de causis; scriptum est de<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nuo ad classes, ut cum <placeName ref="l167">Genevatibus</placeName> pacem colant.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> etiam coactus fuit purgare se coram senatu de <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>calumnia ei aspersa propter carmina quaedam obscoeniora olim <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>quidem a se ędita antequam ad agnitionem veritatis veniret.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName>Purgatus</persName> restitutus est.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sic lacera sunt omnia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Re<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sarciat dominus omnia et piam nobis concedat concordiam!</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>De <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensi</placeName> collecta nihildum constitutum; differetur, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>opinor, donec, quomodo ipsorum res habeant, certo cognoverimus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Affligit etiam illa me causa supra modum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>festinanter admodum.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Reliqua ex fratris literis cognosces.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Salvi sint vestri omnes.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat vos vicissim <persName ref="p8417">Mu<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>sculus</persName>, <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, <persName ref="p8389">Hagius</persName>, <persName ref="p3241">Trempius</persName>, <persName>Dießba<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>chius Gironus</persName> et gratias agunt maximas pro exemplaribus concionum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>missis.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ea, quę per <persName ref="p8052">Ampelandrum</persName> te misisse scribis, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>nondum accepi.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">27. februarii 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Frater tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Remitto tibi literas d. <persName ref="p2866">Thomae Sampsoni</persName> missas; postquam <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>enim <placeName ref="l280">Lausanam</placeName> venerunt, ille iam <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> profectus <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>est cum d. <persName>Emanuele</persName>; inde ergo eas recepi iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>compatri suo honorando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
